Temporarily disable the shared Kokoro/Piper extension.

Both engines use ONNX Runtime and espeak_TextToPhonemesWithTerminator().
Do not require either backend while its system dependencies are unavailable.
Keep the runtime import probe intact so the GUI does not advertise this engine.
Pure Python Kokoro tests remain enabled; its espeak test skips a missing extension.
Rebased from Gentoo calibre-8.9.0-piper.patch.
https://bugs.gentoo.org/961974

